  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 32235ab5eb1ca7740802064132257915, type: 3}
  m_Name: QuizData_AllScenarios
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::VRPCCC.Quiz.QuizQuestionData
  questions:
  - questionText: "Khi ph\xE1t hi\u1EC7n kh\xF3i t\u1EEB d\u01B0\u1EDBi c\xE1nh c\u1EEDa,
      b\u1EA1n n\xEAn m\u1EDF ngay c\u1EEDa ra \u0111\u1EC3 tho\xE1t hi\u1EC3m."
    correctAnswer: 0
    explanation: "KH\xD4NG m\u1EDF c\u1EEDa khi c\xF3 kh\xF3i! Nhi\u1EC7t \u0111\u1ED9
      v\xE0 kh\xF3i \u0111\u1ED9c ph\xEDa sau c\xF3 th\u1EC3 r\u1EA5t nguy hi\u1EC3m.
      H\xE3y d\xF9ng mu b\xE0n tay ch\u1EA1m nh\u1EB9 v\xE0o c\u1EEDa \u0111\u1EC3
      ki\u1EC3m tra nhi\u1EC7t \u0111\u1ED9 tr\u01B0\u1EDBc."
    scenarioTag: 1
  - questionText: "N\xEAn d\xF9ng mu b\xE0n tay (kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i l\xF2ng b\xE0n
      tay) \u0111\u1EC3 ki\u1EC3m tra nhi\u1EC7t \u0111\u1ED9 c\xE1nh c\u1EEDa khi
      nghi ng\u1EDD c\xF3 l\u1EEDa ph\xEDa sau."
    correctAnswer: 1
    explanation: "\u0110\xFAng. D\xF9ng mu b\xE0n tay \u0111\u1EC3 ki\u1EC3m tra
      v\xEC v\xF9ng da n\xE0y nh\u1EA1y c\u1EA3m h\u01A1n. N\u1EBFu d\xF9ng l\xF2ng
      b\xE0n tay v\xE0 c\u1EEDa qu\xE1 n\xF3ng, b\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 b\u1ECB ph\u1ECFng
      v\xE0 m\u1EA5t kh\u1EA3 n\u0103ng c\u1EA7m n\u1EAFm khi tho\xE1t hi\u1EC3m."
    scenarioTag: 1
  - questionText: "C\xE1nh c\u1EEDa c\xF2n \u1EA5m (kh\xF4ng qu\xE1 n\xF3ng) ngh\u0129a
      l\xE0 ho\xE0n to\xE0n an to\xE0n v\xE0 b\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 m\u1EDF c\u1EEDa
      t\u1EF1 do."
    correctAnswer: 0
    explanation: "Ngay c\u1EA3 khi c\u1EEDa \u1EA5m, v\u1EABn c\u1EA7n m\u1EDF c\u1EEDa
      t\u1EEB t\u1EEB v\xE0 c\u1EA9n th\u1EADn. Kh\xF4ng kh\xED n\xF3ng v\xE0 kh\xF3i
      \u0111\u1ED9c c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \xF9a v\xE0o ngay l\u1EADp t\u1EE9c. C\xFAi th\u1EA5p
      ng\u01B0\u1EDDi khi m\u1EDF."
    scenarioTag: 1
  - questionText: "N\u1EBFu c\u1EEDa tho\xE1t hi\u1EC3m qu\xE1 n\xF3ng, b\u1EA1n
      n\xEAn t\xECm \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng tho\xE1t kh\xE1c thay v\xEC m\u1EDF c\u1EEDa
      \u0111\xF3."
    correctAnswer: 1
    explanation: "C\u1EEDa n\xF3ng ngh\u0129a l\xE0 ph\xEDa sau \u0111ang ch\xE1y
      d\u1EEF d\u1ED9i. T\xECm \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng tho\xE1t hi\u1EC3m kh\xE1c, ho\u1EB7c
      quay l\u1EA1i ph\xF2ng, b\u1ECBt khe c\u1EEDa v\xE0 ch\u1EDD c\u1EE9u h\u1ED9."
    scenarioTag: 1
  - questionText: "Khi m\u1EDF c\u1EEDa tho\xE1t hi\u1EC3m, n\xEAn \u0111\u1EE9ng
      th\u1EB3ng \u0111\u1EC3 quan s\xE1t nhanh t\xECnh h\xECnh b\xEAn ngo\xE0i."
    correctAnswer: 0
    explanation: "Lu\xF4n c\xFAi th\u1EA5p khi m\u1EDF c\u1EEDa! Kh\xF3i v\xE0 kh\xED
      \u0111\u1ED9c t\xEDch t\u1EE5 \u1EDF ph\xEDa tr\xEAn. Kh\xF4ng kh\xED s\u1EA1ch
      h\u01A1n \u1EDF g\u1EA7n s\xE0n nh\xE0."
    scenarioTag: 1
  - questionText: "B\xECnh ch\u1EEFa ch\xE1y kh\xED CO\u2082 th\xEDch h\u1EE3p \u0111\u1EC3
      d\u1EADp \u0111\xE1m ch\xE1y thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB \u0111i\u1EC7n, \u0111i\u1EC7n
      t\u1EED."
    correctAnswer: 1
    explanation: "CO\u2082 kh\xF4ng d\u1EABn \u0111i\u1EC7n v\xE0 kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1EC3
      l\u1EA1i ch\u1EA5t b\u1EA9n, r\u1EA5t ph\xF9 h\u1EE3p cho \u0111\xE1m ch\xE1y
      \u0111i\u1EC7n v\xE0 \u0111\xE1m ch\xE1y ch\u1EA5t l\u1ECFng nh\u01B0 t\u1EE7
      l\u1EA1nh."
    scenarioTag: 2
  - questionText: "B\xECnh b\u1ED9t ABC c\xF3 th\u1EC3 d\xF9ng \u0111\u1EC3 d\u1EADp
      \u0111\xE1m ch\xE1y v\u1EA3i, n\u1EC7m, g\u1ED7 (ch\u1EA5t r\u1EAFn h\u1EEFu
      c\u01A1)."
    correctAnswer: 1
    explanation: "B\xECnh b\u1ED9t ABC d\u1EADp \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\xE1m ch\xE1y
      lo\u1EA1i A (ch\u1EA5t r\u1EAFn), B (ch\u1EA5t l\u1ECFng) v\xE0 C (kh\xED/\u0111i\u1EC7n).
      Ph\xF9 h\u1EE3p cho \u0111\xE1m ch\xE1y n\u1EC7m, v\u1EA3i, g\u1ED7 trong ph\xF2ng
      ng\u1EE7."
    scenarioTag: 2
  - questionText: "Kho\u1EA3ng c\xE1ch an to\xE0n \u0111\u1EC3 s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng
      b\xECnh ch\u1EEFa ch\xE1y l\xE0 c\xE0ng g\u1EA7n \u0111\xE1m ch\xE1y c\xE0ng
      t\u1ED1t \u0111\u1EC3 t\u0103ng hi\u1EC7u qu\u1EA3."
    correctAnswer: 0
    explanation: "Kho\u1EA3ng c\xE1ch l\xFD t\u01B0\u1EDFng l\xE0 2\u20133 m\xE9t.
      Qu\xE1 g\u1EA7n s\u1EBD nguy hi\u1EC3m do nhi\u1EC7t v\xE0 c\xF3 th\u1EC3 l\xE0m
      l\u1EEDa b\xF9ng m\u1EA1nh h\u01A1n. Qu\xE1 xa th\xEC ch\u1EA5t ch\u1EEFa ch\xE1y
      kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1EBFn n\u01A1i hi\u1EC7u qu\u1EA3."
    scenarioTag: 2
  - questionText: "Quy tr\xECnh s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng b\xECnh ch\u1EEFa ch\xE1y \u0111\xFAng
      l\xE0: R\xFAt ch\u1ED1t \u2192 H\u01B0\u1EDBng v\xF2i v\xE0o g\u1ED1c l\u1EEDa
      \u2192 B\xF3p c\xF2 \u2192 Qu\xE9t ngang"
    correctAnswer: 1
    explanation: "\u0111\xE2y l\xE0 quy tr\xECnh P.A.S.S.: Pull (r\xFAt ch\u1ED1t),
      Aim (h\u01B0\u1EDBng v\xF2i), Squeeze (b\xF3p c\xF2), Sweep (qu\xE9t ngang).
      Lu\xF4n nh\u1EAFm v\xE0o G\u1ED0C l\u1EEDa, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i ng\u1ECDn l\u1EEDa."
    scenarioTag: 2
  - questionText: "B\xECnh kh\xED CO\u2082 \u0111\u1EC3 l\xE2u kh\xF4ng d\xF9ng v\u1EABn
      lu\xF4n \u0111\u1EA7y v\xE0 s\u1EB5n s\xE0ng s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng m\xE0 kh\xF4ng
      c\u1EA7n b\u1EA3o tr\xEC."
    correctAnswer: 0
    explanation: "B\xECnh ch\u1EEFa ch\xE1y c\u1EA7n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ki\u1EC3m
      tra \u0111\u1ECBnh k\u1EF3 (th\u01B0\u1EDDng 6 th\xE1ng/l\u1EA7n). B\xECnh
      c\xF3 th\u1EC3 b\u1ECB r\xF2 r\u1EC9, h\u1EBFt h\u1EA1n ho\u1EB7c h\u1ECFng
      van. \u0110\xE2y l\xE0 l\u1ED7i PCCC ph\u1ED5 bi\u1EBFn \u1EDF nhi\u1EC1u t\xF2a
      nh\xE0."
    scenarioTag: 2
  - questionText: "Khi t\xF2a nh\xE0 x\u1EA3y ra h\u1ECFa ho\u1EA1n, c\xF3 th\u1EC3
      s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng thang m\xE1y \u0111\u1EC3 di chuy\u1EC3n xu\u1ED1ng t\u1EA7ng
      nhanh h\u01A1n."
    correctAnswer: 0
    explanation: "TUY\u1EC6T \u0110\u1ED0I KH\xD4NG. H\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng \u0111i\u1EC7n
      c\xF3 th\u1EC3 b\u1ECB ng\u1EAFt khi\u1EBFn thang k\u1EB9t gi\u1EEFa ch\u1EEBng.
      H\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng g\u1ECDi thang c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111\u01B0a b\u1EA1n th\u1EB3ng
      v\xE0o t\u1EA7ng \u0111ang ch\xE1y. Lu\xF4n d\xF9ng thang b\u1ED9 tho\xE1t
      hi\u1EC3m."
    scenarioTag: 3
  - questionText: "Khi kh\xF4ng t\u1EF1 d\u1EADp \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u1EEDa, vi\u1EC7c
      \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn c\u1EA7n l\xE0m l\xE0 k\xEDch ho\u1EA1t n\xFAt b\xE1o
      ch\xE1y kh\u1EA9n c\u1EA5p \u0111\u1EC3 c\u1EA3nh b\xE1o m\u1ECDi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi."
    correctAnswer: 1
    explanation: "C\u1EA3nh b\xE1o to\xE0n t\xF2a nh\xE0 l\xE0 \u01B0u ti\xEAn h\xE0ng
      \u0111\u1EA7u khi \u0111\xE1m ch\xE1y v\u01B0\u1EE3t t\u1EA7m ki\u1EC3m so\xE1t.
      M\u1ED7i gi\xE2y tr\u1EC5 c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u1EA3nh h\u01B0\u1EDFng \u0111\u1EBFn
      nhi\u1EC1u ng\u01B0\u1EDDi."
    scenarioTag: 3
  - questionText: "Khi tho\xE1t hi\u1EC3m qua c\u1EA7u thang b\u1ED9 \u0111\u1EA7y
      kh\xF3i, n\xEAn b\u1ECBt m\u0169i v\xE0 \u0111\u1EE9ng th\u1EB3ng \u0111\u1EC3
      ch\u1EA1y nhanh h\u01A1n."
    correctAnswer: 0
    explanation: "Kh\xF3i t\xEDch t\u1EE5 ph\xEDa tr\xEAn, kh\xF4ng kh\xED \u1EDF
      g\u1EA7n s\xE0n s\u1EA1ch h\u01A1n. H\xE3y c\xFAi th\u1EA5p ho\u1EB7c b\xF2
      khi di chuy\u1EC3n qua v\xF9ng c\xF3 kh\xF3i. D\xF9ng kh\u0103n \u1EA9m che
      m\u0169i mi\u1EC7ng n\u1EBFu c\xF3 th\u1EC3."
    scenarioTag: 3
  - questionText: "N\u1EBFu b\u1ECB k\u1EB9t trong ph\xF2ng v\xE0 kh\xF4ng tho\xE1t
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c, n\xEAn b\u1ECBt khe d\u01B0\u1EDBi c\u1EEDa b\u1EB1ng
      kh\u0103n/v\u1EA3i \u0111\u1EC3 ng\u0103n kh\xF3i v\xE0o."
    correctAnswer: 1
    explanation: "B\u1ECBt khe c\u1EEDa l\xE0m ch\u1EADm \u0111\xE1ng k\u1EC3 s\u1EF1
      x\xE2m nh\u1EADp c\u1EE7a kh\xF3i v\xE0 nhi\u1EC7t. Sau \u0111\xF3 ra c\u1EEDa
      s\u1ED5 ra hi\u1EC7u cho l\u1EF1c l\u01B0\u1EE3ng c\u1EE9u h\u1ED9 v\xE0 ch\u1EDD
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c c\u1EE9u."
    scenarioTag: 3
  - questionText: "Khi tho\xE1t hi\u1EC3m th\xE0nh c\xF4ng ra ngo\xE0i, n\xEAn quay
      l\u1EA1i t\xF2a nh\xE0 \u0111\u1EC3 l\u1EA5y t\xE0i s\u1EA3n quan tr\u1ECDng
      c\xF2n b\u1ECF l\u1EA1i."
    correctAnswer: 0
    explanation: "M\u1EA1ng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi quan tr\u1ECDng h\u01A1n t\xE0i s\u1EA3n.
      C\u1EE9u h\u1ECFa chuy\xEAn nghi\u1EC7p c\xF3 thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB b\u1EA3o h\u1ED9
      \u0111\u1EC3 v\xE0o t\xF2a nh\xE0 ch\xE1y. Kh\xF4ng bao gi\u1EDD t\u1EF1 \xFD
      quay l\u1EA1i."
    scenarioTag: 3
  - questionText: "\u0110\u1EB7t v\u1EADt li\u1EC7u d\u1EC5 ch\xE1y (v\u1EA3i, gi\u1EA5y,
      x\u0103ng) g\u1EA7n b\u1EBFp gas l\xE0 m\u1ED9t nguy c\u01A1 h\u1ECFa ho\u1EA1n
      nghi\xEAm tr\u1ECDng."
    correctAnswer: 1
    explanation: "B\u1EBFp gas sinh ra tia l\u1EEDa v\xE0 nhi\u1EC7t. V\u1EADt li\u1EC7u
      d\u1EC5 ch\xE1y trong kho\u1EA3ng c\xE1ch g\u1EA7n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 b\u1ED1c
      ch\xE1y b\u1EA5t ng\u1EDD. V\xF9ng xung quanh b\u1EBFp ph\u1EA3i lu\xF4n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      d\u1ECDn s\u1EA1ch."
    scenarioTag: 4
  - questionText: "B\xECnh gas gia \u0111\xECnh n\xEAn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1EB7t
      \u0111\u1EE9ng, \u1EDF n\u01A1i tho\xE1ng kh\xED v\xE0 xa ngu\u1ED3n nhi\u1EC7t
      \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1EA3m b\u1EA3o an to\xE0n."
    correctAnswer: 1
    explanation: "Gas n\u1EB7ng h\u01A1n kh\xF4ng kh\xED, n\u1EBFu r\xF2 r\u1EC9
      s\u1EBD t\xEDch t\u1EE5 \u1EDF ch\u1ED7 th\u1EA5p. N\u01A1i th\xF4ng tho\xE1ng
      gi\xFAp kh\xED t\u1EA3n ra ngo\xE0i. Ngu\u1ED3n nhi\u1EC7t c\xF3 th\u1EC3 g\xE2y
      ch\xE1y n\u1ED5 ngay l\u1EADp t\u1EE9c."
    scenarioTag: 4
  - questionText: "\u1ED4 \u0111i\u1EC7n c\u1EAFm qu\xE1 nhi\u1EC1u thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB
      c\xF9ng l\xFAc (qu\xE1 t\u1EA3i) kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i l\xE0 nguy\xEAn nh\xE2n
      g\xE2y h\u1ECFa ho\u1EA1n."
    correctAnswer: 0
    explanation: "Qu\xE1 t\u1EA3i \u0111i\u1EC7n l\xE0 m\u1ED9t trong nh\u1EEFng
      nguy\xEAn nh\xE2n h\xE0ng \u0111\u1EA7u g\xE2y h\u1ECFa ho\u1EA1n nh\xE0 \u1EDF
      t\u1EA1i Vi\u1EC7t Nam. D\xE2y \u0111i\u1EC7n n\xF3ng, ch\u1EADp \u0111i\u1EC7n
      d\u1EC5 g\xE2y ch\xE1y. M\u1ED7i \u1ED5 c\u1EAFm ch\u1EC9 n\xEAn c\u1EAFm thi\u1EBFt
      b\u1ECB ph\xF9 h\u1EE3p c\xF4ng su\u1EA5t."
    scenarioTag: 1
  - questionText: "\u0110\u1EC3 b\u1EADt l\u1EEDa, di\xEAm ho\u1EB7c thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB
      g\xE2y l\u1EEDa trong t\u1EA7m v\u1EDBi c\u1EE7a tr\u1EBB em l\xE0 h\xE0nh
      vi nguy hi\u1EC3m v\xE0 vi ph\u1EA1m an to\xE0n PCCC."
    correctAnswer: 1
    explanation: "Tr\u1EBB em hi\u1EBFu k\u1EF3 v\u1EDBi l\u1EEDa nh\u01B0ng ch\u01B0a
      hi\u1EC3u nguy hi\u1EC3m. C\xE1c v\u1EE5 ch\xE1y do tr\u1EBB em g\xE2y ra chi\u1EBFm
      t\u1EF7 l\u1EC7 \u0111\xE1ng k\u1EC3. C\u1EA5t c\xE1c thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB g\xE2y
      l\u1EEDa \u1EDF n\u01A1i cao ho\u1EB7c c\xF3 kh\xF3a."
    scenarioTag: 4
  - questionText: "B\xECnh ch\u1EEFa ch\xE1y gia \u0111\xECnh kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n \u0111\u1EB7t
      \u1EDF v\u1ECB tr\xED c\u1ED1 \u0111\u1ECBnh v\xEC c\xF3 th\u1EC3 di chuy\u1EC3n
      \u0111\u1EBFn n\u01A1i c\u1EA7n khi x\u1EA3y ra ch\xE1y."
    correctAnswer: 0
    explanation: "Khi ch\xE1y x\u1EA3y ra, b\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng c\xF3 th\u1EDDi gian
      t\xECm ki\u1EBFm b\xECnh. B\xECnh ch\u1EEFa ch\xE1y ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      \u0111\u1EB7t \u1EDF v\u1ECB tr\xED c\u1ED1 \u0111\u1ECBnh, d\u1EC5 nh\xECn
      th\u1EA5y, d\u1EC5 ti\u1EBFp c\u1EADn v\xE0 t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 th\xE0nh vi\xEAn
      gia \u0111\xECnh \u0111\u1EC1u bi\u1EBFt v\u1ECB tr\xED."
    scenarioTag: 4
